				<title>SCP-5587</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5587</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5587&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object class:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;Euclid&lt;/span&gt; Keter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special containment procedures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5587 is allowed to roam any location in any SCP site and leave at any time of his choosing. No attempts to stop SCP-5587 from entering or exiting any location should ever, under any circumstances, be attempted. SCP-5587 has his own personal room in site 16, measuring 20x20x20 meters. Any requests by SCP-5587, including human or animal sacrifice, should be followed out to staff’s best abilities. SCP-5587 has security clearance equal to that of the o5 council.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5587 appears as a male human child, around ten (10) years of age. Their is no physical oddities about SCP-5587, but he measures in the top 99% in intelligence of all humans. SCP-5587 appears to possess and completely control some form of omnipotence and omnipresence. SCP-5587 is one of the most powerful SCPs, due to his ability to create a XK-class end-of-the-world&amp;nbsp;scenario. The foundation will do almost anything for them, to prevent mass destruction, earning dislike from most staff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5587 was first brought into foundation custody on 2-2-20██. He was captured due to reports of a school teacher running around ████████, Oregon in the United States of America screaming about a “Demon Child.” Upon investigating this, the SCP Foundation found SCP-5587 playing hopscotch with two (2) frightened children, the numbers and boxes drawn in bodily fluids and instead of a stone, they used a flaming █████. Underestimating it’s power, the foundation took him to what was formerly know as site-██.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For the first nine (9) months, SCP-5587 refused to speak, leading the foundation to believe he was mute. Below is a list of experiments that where conducted before he was given full access.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;wiki-content-table&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;test subjects&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;experiment&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;result&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;notes&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;D-8256, a former MTF unit&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;D-8256 was to enter SCP-5587’s containment cell and remain there for 9 hours&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;after 6 hours of no activity, SCP-5587 made an arc over his head, as if he was saluting the sun, and D-8256 suddenly disappeared&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The remains of D-8256 where found in SCP-96’s containment cell&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;D-4361, a convicted rapist&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;D-4361 was given the same instructions as D-8256&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;As soon as D-4361 entered SCP-5587’s cell, D-4361 disappeared and sixteen (16) spectral humanoid figures appeared in the room, along with two desks, each with two chairs each, a platform with a desk and chair on it, and twelve (12) chairs to the side. Each one of the creatures took a seat at one of the chairs, filling all but one, a chair behind one of the two desks facing the platform. D-4361 then appeared in the empty seat, looking bewildered. The various beings talked to each other, and, after reviewing audio logs, this was determined to be some form of trial, with the beings serving as the judge, jury, defense attorney, prosecution and prosecution attorney, while D-4361 was the defense. SCP-5587 did not talk the entire time, serving as a typist. At the end of the experiment, he slipped a transcript under the cell door. After 15 hours, the jury decided that D-4361 was not guilty. All of the unknown entities disappeared and a stack of evidence appeared in the observation room, proving that D-4361 was innocent. D-4361 was administered class-A amnestics and cleared of all charges the next day.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;“Well, at least the kid has some sense morality,” -Dr. ██████&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-173&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-173 was released into SCP-5587’s containment cell, since no other attempts to terminate SCP-5587 had succeeded.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-173 entered before SCP-5587 turned. SCP-5587 did not blink for one (1) minute and twenty four (24) seconds before grinning and closing his eyes. SCP-173 snapped his neck and SCP-5587 collapsed. SCP-173 then moved to the corner of the cell and stood there for fourth six (46) seconds. SCP-5587 then stood up, apparently with no injuries, and produced a sledgehammer from somewhere out of sight.. He walked up to scp-173 and █████████████████████████████████████████████████████&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;“well, that was&amp;#8230; intense,” Dr. ██████&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-096&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-096 was released into SCP-5587’s cell in order to see the extent of his powers.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-096 entered his rage state, but then SCP-5587 raised his hand towards SCP-096 and SCP-096 calmed down immediately&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;This is the second time SCP-096 ever left his rage state before killing everyone who saw his face&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-682&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Due to SCP-682’s reputation as being “immortal,” SCP-5587 was expected to be terminated.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;As soon as SCP-682 saw SCP-5587, it started screaming to be let out of the cell. SCP-628 entered a catatonic state, recovering 3 days later.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;This event suggests SCP-5587 May be able to terminate SCP-682.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Dr. ██████&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-5587 was given a small speech synthesizer, in order to conduct an interview&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Dr. ██████ explained to SCP-5587 how to use it. Once she was finished, SCP-5587 simply said, “Now why would I use that when I can talk?” SCP-5587 then collapsed Dr. ██████‘s skull with a single punch. SCP-5587 then breached containment, killing twenty-six (26) staff members through various methods, including, but not limited to, stabbing, bludgeoning, shooting, disembowelment, disintegration and ████████&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;upgraded to Keter&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gunther-metz&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7170647&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609229944&quot; alt=&quot;Gunther Metz&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7170647)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gunther-metz&quot;  &gt;Gunther Metz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
