-raynes/Planet"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/the-radical-works-of-marcelles-d-raynes/Planet/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="Planet" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>SCP-5979</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-radical-works-of-marcelles-d-raynes/awcy.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="awcy.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>Are We Cool Yet?</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-radical-works-of-marcelles-d-raynes/Foundation"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/the-radical-works-of-marcelles-d-raynes/Foundation/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="Foundation" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>The logo we all know and love.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-radical-works-of-marcelles-d-raynes/yt"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/the-radical-works-of-marcelles-d-raynes/yt/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="yt" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>I love my job. (Click to activate)</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-radical-works-of-marcelles-d-raynes/Retro"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/the-radical-works-of-marcelles-d-raynes/Retro/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="Retro" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>Pixel art street scene for Christmas.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class=