					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="preview" style="display: none;"> <p>Exaggerations were never beneath her — she always tended to have an eye for whimsy — but castles that rise up into the sky? Stars that shine as bright in the day as at night? Land of honey? Whatever she described, it was not New York. <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;</span></p> </div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Author's Note:</strong> This Tale has FOUR different chapters. Please see the navigation links at the bottom of each page to view the next part of the article!</p> </blockquote> <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="info-container"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div> <p><strong>Land of Honey</strong><br /> <strong>Authors:</strong> KindlyTurtleClem and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609229952" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span> (<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/floppyphoenix" target="_blank">Author Page</a>)</p> <p>This article was written by <strong>FIRE TURTLE (Clem &amp; Floppy)</strong> for the <strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/collaboration-contest" target="_blank">2019 Collaboration Contest</a></strong>! The two primary Groups of Interest featured are <strong>Fifthism</strong> and <strong>Church of the Second Hytoth</strong>.</p> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4475" target="_blank">Go here for the second entry!</a></strong></p> <hr /> <p><strong>Special Thanks:</strong><br /> To the following fine critters for their great feedback on this work:</p> <ul> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1613974&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609229952" alt="UraniumEmpire" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1613974)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" >UraniumEmpire</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609229952" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span></li> <li><span class="error-inline"><em>YossiLeiner</em> does not match any existing user name</span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pokemonprime" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2000294&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609229952" alt="Pokemonprime" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2000294)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pokemonprime" >Pokemonprime</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/radioactiverads" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5053587&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609229952" alt="RadioactiveRADS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5053587)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/radioactiverads" >RadioactiveRADS</a></span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187885&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609229952" alt="Rounderhouse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187885)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" >Rounderhouse</a></span></li> <li><span class="error-inline"><em>magnadeus</em> does not match any existing user name</span></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/woedenaz" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404096&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609229952" alt="Woedenaz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404096)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/woedenaz" >Woedenaz</a></span></li> </ul> <p><strong>Image Sources:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Iteration 2: <a href="https://www.loc.gov/resource/ppprs.00502/">Photo of Women</a> – The Library of Congress, No known copyright restrictions</strong></li> <li><strong>Iteration 3: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/component:uiu-bhl-theme#toc1">UIU Logo</a> – CC BY-SA 3.0</strong></li> <li><strong>Iteration 3: <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_Ponzi#/media/File:Ponzi1920.jpg">Charles Ponzi/Marina</a> – Public domain</strong></li> <li><strong>Iteration 4: <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/106074308@N06/42806140905">Construction Paper</a> – Public domain</strong></li> </ul> </div> <hr /> <div id="u-author_block"> <p style="text-align: center;">[{$authorPage} ▸ More by this Author ◂]</p> <hr /></div> <div class="translation_block"> <h1><span>Translations:</span></h1> </div> <div class="u-faq"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/component:info-ayers">F.A.Q.</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="licensebox"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> Banquet of the wives of the &quot;Ten Annuals&quot;<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> The Library of Congress<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> Wright, Wilbur<br /> <strong>License:</strong> Public Domain<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://www.loc.gov/resource/ppprs.00502/">https://www.loc.gov/resource/ppprs.00502/</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> Charles Ponzi/Marina<br /> <stron