				<title>SCP-5129</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5129</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ITEM #: SCP-5129&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OBJECT CLASS: Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SPECIAL CONTAINMENT PROCEDURES:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;this item must be hooked up to electricity at all times and kept in a well light 3 x 3 x 3 meter room&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DESCRIPTION :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This sign was found at a ██████████ at █████,Florida, it is a 1/4 by 1/2 a meter in size and simply reads HAM BISCUIT. We have not been able to find a reason for its existence but it is impossible to photograph this item due to its sudden disappearance when photographed by conventional means. it is currently contained at site ██ and has been classified as safe by all scientist at the site, and has not shown a sign of sentience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hichad25&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6838883&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609229952&quot; alt=&quot;hichad25&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6838883)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hichad25&quot;  &gt;hichad25&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
